    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Threats_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Mandalorians\" title=\"The Mandalorians\">The Mandalorians</a> (Organization) </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b>&nbsp;Any Armor </p><p>Mandalorian Armor is constructed of a rare iron alloy, favored for its strength and durability, as well as its ability to turn away&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>&nbsp;attacks. The Mandalorians guard the secret of producing Armor made from this material, making it especially rare in the galaxy. </p><p>The Mandalorian Armor Template is typically&nbsp;applied to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Battle_Armor\" title=\"Battle Armor\">Battle Armor</a>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heavy_Battle_Armor\" title=\"Heavy Battle Armor\">Heavy Battle Armor</a>. </p><p><b>Armor:</b> A Suit of Armor with the Mandalorian Armor Template has its&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a>&nbsp;bonus to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>&nbsp;increase by +1. Additionally, if the wearer has&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a>, they can apply its benefit against attacks made by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsabers\" title=\"Lightsabers\">Lightsabers</a>. </p><p>In some eras, particularly during <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Wars\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Mandalorian Wars\">The Mandalorian Wars</a>, the armor alone grants favorable circumstances on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a>&nbsp;checks made to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intimidate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a>. </p>",
